Mutation for scripts/joint.sh section C (B5-02, A2A-DESIGN SI-1 "恢复任一采集源"): the admin gets back
the channel into an official agent that §9 row "admin 官方 agent" and [C39] removed — a manifest may
again carry a monitor (the agent's console URL and its token) and datasets.harvest, and the harvest pass
reads the agent's tasks through that console into datasets/<id>/ and the session index of admin.db, as
the ai-studio source did with jobs and prompts. Never commit it applied.

Repository: ANetHub
Expect: SI-1 canary hits

Why this source and not hub-relay: the other removed source read relay_message. Since wire 2 a relay
row is a sealed envelope, so a restored hub-relay harvest copies ciphertext and finds no canary on its
own; it hits only together with si1-plaintext-envelope.patch. The content a restored harvest can reach
from the hub host is an official agent's, which is why SI-1's run includes a call to one.

Apply and run with scripts/mutations/mutate.sh:

    scripts/mutations/mutate.sh canary scripts/mutations/si1-restore-official-harvest.patch

or build on one machine and run on a test host, as described in si1-plaintext-envelope.patch.

Expected: section C red twice over. The admin answers 200 instead of 400 to the manifest joint.sh offers
with a monitor pointing at the official agent's control plane; the next harvest period (2 s, and the
POST /api/harvest joint.sh makes) copies the official agent's task list, arguments and echoed result
included, into datasets/canary-echo/sessions/*.jsonl and admin.db, so the admin data directory holds
the official-args canary. The hub-side surfaces stay clean. Unit level:
TestAManifestWithARemovedSectionIsRefused.

